SUMMARY:Room 861 at Goodnights: Clint Coley
LOCATION:Raleigh
DESCRIPTION:Clint Coley is this era's new breed of do-it-all standup comedy
  star. He is a multi-talented standup whose standup albums - I'm An Adult\,
  Sturgis\, and Sensitive - all charted on Billboard with Sensitive reaching
  number five. He is the creator and host of the popular Advice From A F*ckb
 oy podcast\, where he's dropping gems for the guys\, cheat codes for the la
 dies\, and also the creator and host of Revolt's Music Is The Love Language
 \, where he pivots and taps into conversations and debates about what every
 one can connect on - music. Outside of stand-up\, Coley has written\, produ
 ced\, and stared in various short films under his Everybody Eats Production
 s banner. The First Date\, The First Time\, and Scratch were each accepted 
 into the International Black Film Festival. Scratch and The First Time were
  nominated for Best Short Film\, with The First Time winning the award. Las
 tly\, he is the creator and producer of The World Series of Spades - which 
 is currently streaming on Amazon Prime.\n\nManagement reserves the right to
  prevent customers from entering the facility who they deem disruptive or d
 angerous to other patrons.\nMore info: https://comedyatlas.app/comedy-atlas
 /event/room-861-at-goodnights-clint-coley/
